{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPER ADVENTURE</strong> is a playful Run 'n' Gun <i><strong>Fun</strong></i> Platformer with great emphasis on <strong>bullet blocking</strong>, cool\u00a0<strong>boss fights</strong> and a <i><strong>wacky</strong></i><strong> <i>story</i></strong>. <strong>WOOAHH</strong> <strong>CAN'T WAIT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/5f0c08af47aae6c5103f3e3b212926dc.webp?t=1763425164\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/5f0c08af47aae6c5103f3e3b212926dc.poster.avif?t=1763425164\" class=\"bb_img\" width=768 height=212 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sleep was interrupted by Aliens! Oh no! They destroyed your house, and kidnapped your best cow friend Mumu! So you head out to find them! On your way you are given an irreplaceable item that holds great importance on your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/6a8646e7d39fe6f1537d8cc4b81ad90f.apng?t=1763425164\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/6a8646e7d39fe6f1537d8cc4b81ad90f.poster.avif?t=1763425164\" class=\"bb_img\" width=768 height=444 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SHIELD</strong> is an defensive Mechanic that is\u00a0<strong>always active</strong>\u00a0and <strong>locked to your backside.\u00a0 </strong> <br>  <br>To block you just have to <strong>TURN AROUND!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re about to get shot!? <strong>Turn around</strong>!  <br>Someone trying to stab you!? <strong>Turn around</strong>!  <br>Taxes trying to ruin your life? <strong>JUST TURN AROUND! </strong>(maybe not this one...)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever attack may come your way, you can count on your <strong>SHIELD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/79f9b20668ea7dbadfa3467e3206930e.poster.avif?t=1763425164\" width=768 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/79f9b20668ea7dbadfa3467e3206930e.webm?t=1763425164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUT DEFENSE ALONE WON'T WIN NO BATTLE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your SWORD </strong>and engage in close quarter combat. <strong>Juggle</strong> your enemies and go for <strong>satisfying COMBOS</strong>! <i>Style on your Opponents</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/6e9d95adade315dcc412086d5abf8ed0.poster.avif?t=1763425164\" width=768 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/6e9d95adade315dcc412086d5abf8ed0.webm?t=1763425164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or switch to the <strong>ALIEN BLASTER</strong>\u00a0and attack enemies form afar. Go for consecutive hits, charge the blasters Engine, <strong>MAKE IT OVERHEAT</strong> and <strong>LEVEL UP</strong> your <strong>ATTACK POWER</strong>! But be careful! Being too passive will make the blaster revert back to level 1!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/e92482279fa5a270c9a8530d2f31110d.poster.avif?t=1763425164\" width=768 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/e92482279fa5a270c9a8530d2f31110d.webm?t=1763425164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/e92482279fa5a270c9a8530d2f31110d.mp4?t=1763425164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch freely between the 2 weapons at any time! Approach any Situtation however you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can you see already in this Demo?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a special version of the first 2 Levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight two Mini bosses and one Main Boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to use the Shield, Sword and Gun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet wacky characters along the Way!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/ad6c1d81cb40eb70e785730d0b9ad27f.poster.avif?t=1763425164\" width=768 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154910/extras/ad6c1d81cb40eb70e785730d0b9ad27f.webm?t=1763425164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woah you read all the way down here...   <br>Thats crazy   <br><strong>Its like we are friends already!\u00a0</strong>tehee   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st